{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41653","headline":"殿前生桂树 · 陈陶","name":"殿前生桂树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僊娥玉宫秋夜明，桂枝拂槛参差琼。\n香风下天漏丁丁，牛渚翠梁横浅清羽帐不眠恨吹笙。\n栖乌暗惊僊子落，步月鬃云堕金雀。\n蕙楼凉簟翠波空，银缕香寒凤皇薄。\n东海即爲郎斟酌，绮疏长悬七星杓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}